<<PLACEHOLDER: list 3-5 project-specific gotchas. Examples:
- Forgetting to run gqlgen after schema changes causes drift errors in CI
- The User model has a soft-delete flag; always filter on deleted_at IS NULL
- Apollo cache updates must happen in the mutation resolver, not the component
- Python datetime objects must be UTC-aware; use timezone.now() not datetime.now()
- Goroutines must be cleaned up; always use errgroup or context cancellation
